%% Sequence: Resume render lifecycle.
%% From a user data/vector/override change to a rendered PDF blob URL.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant BP as "[D-13] BuildPage"
    participant ASM as "[D-14] assembler"
    participant PB as "[D-15] pageBudget"
    participant HK as "[D-16] usePdfPreview"
    participant W as "[D-17] typst.worker"
    participant Blob as "[D-18] Blob URL"

    User->>BP: data / vector / overrides change
    Note over BP: useMemo recomputes
    BP->>ASM: assembleResume(data, options)
    ASM->>PB: applyPageBudget(assembled, opts)
    PB-->>ASM: AssemblyResult.resume
    ASM-->>BP: AssemblyResult
    BP->>HK: pass assembled to hook
    Note over HK: 400ms debounce, generation++
    HK->>W: postMessage({id, data, theme, fontFiles, template})
    W->>W: snippet.pdf({mainContent, inputs})
    W->>HK: postMessage({id, type:'success', bytes}, [bytes.buffer])
    Note over HK: discard if id != current generation
    HK->>Blob: URL.createObjectURL(blob)
    Blob-->>User: rendered PDF in iframe
